      "summary": "Quilt (tifaifai) for a double bed, nearly square, made of cotton. Appliquéd mid-blue design on white background. Hand-stitched. Fan (&#039;evantail&#039;) design; an array of patterned fans with crenelated edges, cut out symmetrically along four axes. As part of the same piece of blue fabric, there is a deep border around edge of the quilt with a small flower pattern at regular intervals. Tiny stitches in blue thread visible on back of quilt.",
